## Animation System

### Creating Animations

```
1. Select Player in Hierarchy
2. Window > Animation > Animation
3. Create new clip: Player_Idle
4. Drag sprite frames into timeline
5. Set Samples (frame rate): 12

Animations to create:
├── Player_Idle (loop)
├── Player_Run (loop)
├── Player_Jump (no loop)
└── Player_Fall (loop)
```

### Animator Controller

```
Window > Animation > Animator

States:
├── Idle (default)
├── Run
├── Jump
└── Fall

Parameters:
├── Speed (Float)
├── IsGrounded (Bool)
└── VerticalVelocity (Float)

Transitions:
├── Idle → Run: Speed > 0.1
├── Run → Idle: Speed < 0.1
├── Any → Jump: !IsGrounded && VerticalVelocity > 0
├── Jump → Fall: VerticalVelocity < 0
└── Fall → Idle: IsGrounded
```

